  "solution": {
    "text": "Arithmetic mean $\\bar{x}$ of $4,7,8,9,10,12,13$, 17 is<br />$\\bar{x}=$ $\\frac{4+7+8+9+10+12+13+17}{8}=\\frac{80}{8}=10$<br />$\\Sigma\\left|x_i-\\bar{x}\\right|=6+3+2+1+0+2+3+7=24$<br />$\\therefore$ Mean deviation about mean<br />$=\\text { M.D. }(\\bar{x})=\\frac{\\sum\\left|x_i-\\bar{x}\\right|}{n}=\\frac{24}{8}=3$",
    "image": null
